# MAC Allowlist for unknown device blocking
# One MAC per line. Lines starting with # are comments.
# Format: MAC_ADDRESS  # optional comment (device name)
#
# Only devices listed here will have internet access.
# All unknown devices (including randomized MACs) will be blocked.

# Parents
aa:bb:cc:dd:ee:f1  # Dad's phone
aa:bb:cc:dd:ee:f2  # Mom's phone
aa:bb:cc:dd:ee:f3  # Dad's laptop
aa:bb:cc:dd:ee:f4  # Mom's laptop

# Alice (child 1) - also in parental_profiles
aa:bb:cc:dd:ee:01  # Alice's phone
aa:bb:cc:dd:ee:02  # Alice's laptop

# Bob (child 2) - also in parental_profiles
aa:bb:cc:dd:ee:03  # Bob's phone
aa:bb:cc:dd:ee:04  # Bob's tablet

# Other household devices
aa:bb:cc:dd:ee:f5  # Smart TV
aa:bb:cc:dd:ee:f6  # NAS
aa:bb:cc:dd:ee:f7  # Printer